    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Rooney’s are delighted to present St. Anne’s, Annacotty, Co. Limerick — a truly impressive and exceptionally spacious detached residence set on a large, private site in one of the most sought-after residential locations in the Castletroy area.\r\nThis superb home is approached via a tarmacadam driveway with electric gates, providing ample off-street parking and a well-maintained front garden. To the rear lies a beautifully private garden, complete with a generous patio area ideal for outdoor dining and entertaining, together with a large detached garage and excellent side access.\r\nInternally, the property is presented to an exceptional standard throughout, with bright, generously proportioned accommodation designed for modern family living.\r\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, spacious living room, kitchen / dining room, utility room, main bathroom, office / playroom, bar / entertainment room, and a downstairs bedroom, offering excellent flexibility for multi-generational living or home-working.\r\nUpstairs, there are three well-appointed bedrooms. The main bedroom benefits from a walk-in wardrobe and en-suite bathroom, while a further family bathroom completes the first-floor accommodation.\r\nSt. Anne’s is finished and maintained to a very high standard both internally and externally, offering a turnkey opportunity for prospective purchasers.\r\nThe location is second to none, within easy reach of all local amenities including Castletroy College, Monaleen National School, Milford National School, and the University of Limerick. Residents are also well served by Castletroy Shopping Centre, local shops, award-winning bars and restaurants, and nearby recreational amenities including Castletroy Golf Club and Castletroy Park. The property also enjoys excellent connectivity to all major road networks, including the M7. Contact Peter Kearney."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Prime Annacotty location close to all amenities\r\nHigh Energy rating of B3\r\nMature and spacious private rear garden.\r\nGreat local walks and cycle lanes on the nearby Greenway and Castletroy Park\r\nBright spacious and well proportioned living and bedroom accommodation\r\nThis home oozes location location location\r\nSuperb opportunity to create a beautiful family home in premium setting\r\nA home of great distinction."
      },
